quiet.md #28: Window::present_next_frame_in_transaction

Draw the next frame through PlatformWindow::draw_in_transaction: on macOS the
layer presents that frame with the Core Animation transaction (upstream's
presentsWithTransaction switch), together with native views changed while it
rendered; other platforms draw as usual. The sidebar glass
(NSGlassEffectView) changes size or visibility in the same frame as GPUI's
picture instead of a refresh ahead of it.

